{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>即日焦點｜新皇崗口岸啟用：陳國基指運作暢順　本台實測新口岸過關所需時間較舊口岸快14分鐘</strong></p><p>・新皇崗口岸正式啟用<br>・陳國基指運作暢順<br>・本台實測新口岸過關較舊口岸快<br>・過關時間快約14分鐘</p><p>暫時未能從Now 新聞擷取全文。</p><p><a href=\"https://news.now.com/home/local/player?newsId=665572\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">閱讀原文</a></p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T15:39:47.752577+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"minimal"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T15:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T15:37:47.363175+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T15:37:47.363175+00:00","content_hash":"df026a8d8872c1959276065a9a7b428ef889b278af75dcd98b5814967501225d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}